A '''web''' is an attackable NPC thrown by [[Verzik Vitur]] that bind players who are stuck on them.

The web has 10 hitpoints. If the player is not wearing [[aranea boots]], they will be bound on the tile the web is occupying and be unable to run over them. If the player is not freed in a set amount of time, the web will snap, dealing high damage to all caught players. Wearing the boots will prevent the damage from occurring if caught in one.

Despite the web being a [[monster]], attempting to cast [[Monster Examine]] on a web yields the message {{mes|You can't find out their stats.}}.